<!doctype html>
<html>
<body>
<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
<h1 style="color: #4CAF50;">Predict &amp; Win Results - WattsUp Energy</h1>
<p>Dear {{name}},</p>
<p>Your prediction for <strong>{{month}} {{year}}</strong> has been evaluated against actual energy generation.</p>
<table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 20px 0;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;"><strong>Your Prediction</strong></td>
    <td style="padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;">{{predictedKwh}} kWh</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;"><strong>Actual Generation</strong></td>
    <td style="padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;">{{actualKwh}} kWh</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;"><strong>Accuracy</strong></td>
    <td style="padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;">{{accuracy}}%</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 8px;"><strong>Reward Earned</strong></td>
    <td style="padding: 8px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4CAF50;">{{rewardTokens}} WATT</td>
  </tr>
</table>
{{#if transactionHash}}
<p><strong>Transaction Hash:</strong></p>
<p style="background-color: #f5f5f5; padding: 10px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: monospace; word-break: break-all;">{{transactionHash}}</p>
{{/if}}
{{#if rewardTokens}}
<p>Congratulations! Your reward tokens have been transferred to your wallet.</p>
{{else}}
<p>Thank you for participating. Keep predicting — higher accuracy earns WATT token rewards!</p>
{{/if}}
<p>Best regards,<br>WattsUp Energy Team</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
